1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,799
Mumbai. The twenty-eighth of August, twenty twenty-four.

2
00:00:04,349 --> 00:00:13,480
A tribunal admits a company into insolvency. Its order relies on precedents that never existed. Generated by AI.

3
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:20,480
An appeal fails. It takes almost two years, and the Supreme Court, to set it all aside.

4
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:30,971
The Court compared fake AI precedents to the Bhopal gas. Invisible. Insidious. And catastrophic, by the time anyone notices.

5
00:00:31,521 --> 00:00:37,019
And it declared: citing AI judgments without verification is misconduct.

6
00:00:37,569 --> 00:00:47,802
Stanford researchers found legal AI tools hallucinate in one of six queries, or more. So at eleven at night, before a ten A M hearing, how do you check every line?

7
00:00:48,352 --> 00:00:53,038
Meet CourtroomAI. The AI proposes. Code verifies.

8
00:00:53,588 --> 00:01:08,483
Facts must match the FIR word for word. Sections come from the official table. Every judgment must exist, its quote must match exactly, and Nemotron Ultra must prove support with a quote we check too.

9
00:01:09,033 --> 00:01:15,491
Here is a dowry harassment FIR, with fictional names. We act for the defence.

10
00:01:16,041 --> 00:01:29,491
Nemotron Nano reads the FIR. Sections map by the date of the offence. Nemotron Super drafts, but cannot write the brief. Nemotron Ultra checks every judgment. All on Nebius Token Factory.

11
00:01:30,041 --> 00:01:42,491
Every fact is highlighted in the FIR. Every judgment shows its exact paragraph and a link. And whatever failed a check is listed, with the reason.

12
00:01:43,041 --> 00:01:46,608
One click, and it is a report you can file.

13
00:01:47,158 --> 00:01:52,582
Now the reverse. Paste any draft. Even one written by another AI.

14
00:01:53,132 --> 00:02:08,846
A real case, cited correctly: verified. The same case, twisted: flagged. A case we do not hold is fetched live with Tavily, and checked the same way. And a judgment that never existed: caught.

15
00:02:09,396 --> 00:02:21,187
Across 26 practice cases, every planted fake was caught. The checks removed 49 percent of what the AI drafted, and no unverified name or number reached a brief.

16
00:02:21,737 --> 00:02:33,374
That tribunal's order took almost two years to undo. Checking a citation should take seconds. CourtroomAI. Every sentence, checked against the source.
